Package: panasonic-posture-manager
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: adogecheems <adogecheems@outlook.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: dbus, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4), gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.12), iio-sensor-proxy, libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.4), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.12), polkitd, python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, systemd
Suggests: gnome-settings-daemon, gnome-shell, kscreen, mutter, plasma-workspace
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/adogecheems/panasonic-posture-manager
Description: posture management and screen orientation for convertible laptops
 Provides automatic posture detection, screen rotation, and built-in keyboard
 and touchpad management for Panasonic QV-series and compatible convertible
 2-in-1 laptops.
 .
 The privileged daemon owns the system D-Bus name and relay.  A per-user
 session adapter integrates with GNOME Wayland and KDE Plasma 6 Wayland.
